 GO
watch of DBGCMD\RESULT at DBGCMD\START\%LINE 36
    36:         MOVL    R0, RESULT
   old value: 00000000
   new value: 00000078
break at DBGCMD\START\%LINE 37
    37:         MOVL    #3, R3                  ; a loop of branches
 SHOW WATCH
watchpoint of DBGCMD\WATCHL
watchpoint of DBGCMD\WATCHB
watchpoint of DBGCMD\BUFFER[0:15]
 GO
watch of DBGCMD\WATCHL at DBGCMD\START\%LINE 40
    40:         ADDL2   #2, WATCHL              ; writes the watched longword
   old value: 00000000
   new value: 00000002
break at DBGCMD\START\ODD
    41: ODD:    SOBGTR  R3, LOOP
 SHOW CALLS
 module name     routine name      line                rel PC           abs PC
*DBGCMD          START               41               0000002C         0000042C
 !
 ! A DEPOSIT doesn't trigger a watchpoint.
 DEPOSIT WATCHL = 5
 EXAMINE WATCHL
DBGCMD\WATCHL:  00000005
 !
